OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Fri 30 Oct to Sun 8 NovFA
OL,6,Fband of rain will make erratic
OL,7,Feastward progress at the start of this
OL,8,Fperiod, clearing to the east or dying
OL,9,Fout as high pressure becomes more
OL,10,Fdominant in the vicinity of the UK.
OL,11,FInto early November, high pressure
OL,12,Fwill most likely be the dominant
OL,13,Ffeature near the UK, meaning drier
OL,14,Fthan normal conditions for most if not
OL,15,Fall areas, though it could be rather
OL,16,Fcloudy and grey at times. If light
OL,17,Fwinds and/or clear skies combine
OL,18,Fovernight, then areas of fog could
OL,19,Fdevelop. Overall, temperatures are
OL,20,Flikely to be close to normal, but with
OL,21,Fthe potential for cold nights with
OL,22,Fsome frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
