OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G3/3
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 9 Nov to Mon 23 Nov
OL,6,FProbably settled at first, perhaps
OL,7,Fwith some chilly nights. Moving
OL,8,Ffurther into November, there is an
OL,9,Fincreased chance of more unsettled
OL,10,Fconditions developing, with a return
OL,11,Fto spells of rain and potential for
OL,12,Fstrong winds. However, the extent and
OL,13,Flocation of wettest or windiest areas
OL,14,Fis uncertain. Overall, temperatures
OL,15,Fwill probably be near or a little
OL,16,Fabove average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
